ive financial edge, roughly $3.3 million on hand against about $172,000 for Democrat Chris Gallant, and has drawn Likely or Solid R ratings from most expert raters, though a few list the race as Lean R.\n\nGallant's campaign was rocked in mid-September when reports confirmed he had modeled bondage gear before entering politics, drawing national coverage. A December Democratic-sponsored poll showed a narrow three-point race, but no recent public polling exists. Prediction markets price the Republican around 83%, and the forecast expects LaLota to win by roughly seven points, with meaningful uncertainty given the thin polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1953, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.158, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1553, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.188, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1399, "margin": -7.0}]}